stress-ng  will  stress  test  a  computer system in various selectable way=
s.
It was designed to exercise  various  physical  subsystems  of  a computer =
 as
well  as  the various operating system kernel interfaces. stress-ng also ha=
s a
wide range  of  CPU  specific  stress  tests  that exercise floating point,
integer, bit manipulation and control flow.

More info refers to: http://manpages.ubuntu.com/manpages/xenial/man1/stress=
-ng.1.html

